<h1>Our Mission</h1>

<p>We are the Pink Ribbon Alliance, and our goal is to provide aid and support
to breast cancer patients and their loved ones. We have over 1,000 staff across
100 locations nationwide. Our staff, professionals, and support services are
available 24/7 and have already assisted over 10,000 breast cancer patients.</p>


